<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Harte-Hanks raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Harte-Hanks raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns upgraded Harte-Hanks Communications Inc to buy from attractive, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Earlier Monday, E.W. Scripps Co said it had agreed to buy six newspapers, a television station and a radio station from Harte-Hanks for as much as $625 million, mostly in stock.</p>
<p>-- Harte-Hanks was up 1-3/8 to 30-3/8.</p>
